# Consuming Aberration: once it loses all abilities its characteristic-defining ability no longer sets its power and toughness,
# and each star is worth 0 (CR 604.3, 208.2a): the Aberration is a 0/0 creature, here alive under Bot1's Glorious Anthem as a 1/1.
# With Bot2's Lightning Bolt in its graveyard and the Island that casting the Anthem on turn 5 has Bot2 reveal and put there, the
# Aberration is a 3/3 with the Anthem; Bot2's The Wondrous Wasp takes its abilities away on turn 6, and it is a 1/1 (the two cards
# still in Bot2's graveyard no longer count).

